<h1>The codes, decoded</h1>
<p class="lede">This project keeps a working record, and the record uses short codes. A reader shouldn't have to guess them. Here is what each one means. (This decodes the <em>codes</em>. A separate <a href="{{ '/docs/glossary/' | url }}">glossary</a> already defines the project's three contested terms — "systems theory," "today," "understanding" — and its systems vocabulary. A plain-language glossary of the project's load-bearing <em>operational words</em> — catch, governor, rung, pressure-test, and the rest — is still the author's to write and is on the queue.)</p>

<h2>Sessions</h2>
<p>A <strong>session</strong> is one working block. They run S1, S2, S3, S4, and then the fourth block subdivides as work intensified: S4, S4b, S4c … through S4h, S4i, S4j, S4k. So <strong>S4h</strong> means "the eighth working block of the fourth phase," S4i the ninth, S4j the tenth, and S4k the eleventh — the author's ratifying close, where the build was closed. Nothing deeper is meant by the letters — they are just a counter.</p>

<h2>The fourteen pressure-tests</h2>
<p>The project's symptoms of "today" are organized in four layers, each with a letter-code, plus one cross-cutting test:</p>
<table class="cov">
  <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Layer</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>M</td><td>Master</td><td>the coherence vacuum — the loss of a shared "why"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>D1–D4</td><td>Drivers</td><td>acceleration · optimization · the wealth pump (inequality) · machine intelligence</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Y1–Y4</td><td>Dynamics</td><td>epistemic breakdown · coordination failure · institutional decay · ecological overshoot</td></tr>
    <tr><td>S1–S4</td><td>Symptoms</td><td>fertility collapse · the attention/dopamine economy · populism · anomie &amp; loneliness</td></tr>
    <tr><td>R</td><td>Cross-cutting</td><td>register / care fairness — does the account (and the apparatus producing it) under-weight the reproductive, domestic, relational register; sits <em>across</em> the four layers, not inside one. A falsifiable test, not yet run (added S4k, promoted from disagreement D-005)</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

